msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 統制機構のジン＝キサラギと、お見受けするが相違ないか？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_00"
msgid "Jin Kisaragi from the Library, I presume?"
msgstr ""
"Як бачу, переді мною Джін Кісараґі з Організації\n"
"Контролю. Чи не так?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ん？……ああ、その奇妙な服はイカルガの――
#. JA:   確か「ニンジャ」とかいったか。その忍者とやらが何の用だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_01"
msgid ""
"Hmm?...Oh, those strange clothes...\n"
"You must be from Ikaruga. A...\"ninja\", right?\n"
"What does a ninja want with me?"
msgstr ""
"Гм?.. А, це дивне вбрання з Ікаруґи... Здається, вас\n"
"називали «нінджя». Чого тобі від мене, нінджя?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ぬおおぉぉぉ～～！！い、いけしゃあしゃあといってくれる！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_02"
msgid "Nuoooooooh! How dare you mock me!"
msgstr ""
"Нооо-о-о!! Я-як ти смієш говорити це з таким\n"
"незворушним виглядом?!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 拙者の名はシシガミ＝バング！
#. JA:   まさかこの顔の傷、見忘れたとはいわせんぞ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_03"
msgid ""
"My name is Bang Shishigami!\n"
"Don't tell me you've forgotten this face!"
msgstr ""
"Мене звати Банґ Шішіґамі! Тільки не кажи, що забув цей\n"
"шрам на моєму обличчі!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 殿の遺言、かたくなに守り続けてきたが、
#. JA:   お主を目の前にしておいそれと見逃すわけにはいかぬでござる！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_04"
msgid ""
"I've tried to live my life by my master's last words...\n"
"But now that I've seen you, I don't think I can do that\n"
"anymore..."
msgstr ""
"Я непохитно дотримувався останньої волі мого володаря,\n"
"та коли ти стоїш переді мною, я не можу просто дозволити\n"
"тобі піти!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 殿っ、申し訳ございませんっっっ！！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_05"
msgid "Forgive me, Master!"
msgstr "Мій володарю, пробачте мені!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 「人を憎むな悪を憎め」というこの誓い、
#. JA:   今ここで、破らせて頂きます！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_06"
msgid ""
"My last vow to you...\"Don't hate people...hate evil\"...\n"
"I'm afraid I'll have to break it today!"
msgstr ""
"«Ненавидь не людину, а зло» — нині я порушу цю\n"
"клятву!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: カグツチの努力と根性を守る使者！
#. JA:   悪に屈せぬ男「シシガミ＝バング」、ここに見参！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_07"
msgid ""
"I am the protector of Kagutsuchi's soul!\n"
"I, Bang Shishigami, will not let evil pass by!"
msgstr ""
"Посланець, що береже завзяття й незламний дух Каґуцучі!\n"
"Банґ Шішіґамі — муж, що не скориться злу, — прибув!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ここで会ったが、１００万光年！！殿の仇討たせていただく！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_08"
msgid ""
"Haha, I will not miss this opportunity!\n"
"My master's death will be avenged!"
msgstr ""
"Цієї зустрічі я чекав мільйон світлових років!! Я помщуся\n"
"за мого володаря!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ジン＝キサラギ！正義の名の下にお主をぶっ飛ばす！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_09"
msgid "Jin Kisaragi! In the name of justice, I must destroy you!"
msgstr ""
"Джіне Кісараґі! Іменем справедливості я відправлю тебе в\n"
"політ!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: うるさいぞ貴様。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_10"
msgid "Do you ever shut up?"
msgstr "Замовкни вже."

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ぐはっ、殿、無念で、ござる……ガク。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_11"
msgid "Gugh! Master...I'm...sorry..."
msgstr "Ґха... Мій володарю... Я не зміг... Кх."

#. Key: ArcEveJN01_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ふん、障害にもならない屑が。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN01_12"
msgid "Hmph. What a waste of time."
msgstr "Хм. Непотріб, навіть перешкода марна."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: キサラギ少佐！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_00"
msgid "Major Kisaragi!"
msgstr "Майоре Кісараґі!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 貴様か。何の用だヴァーミリオン少尉。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_01"
msgid "Oh, it's you. What do you want, Lieutenant Vermillion?"
msgstr "А, це ти. Що тобі треба, лейтенантко Верміліон?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 少佐は重大な命令違反を犯しています。
#. JA:   今なら不問に付すというのが統合本部からの意向です。
#. JA:   ですから、至急隊にお戻りください。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_02"
msgid ""
"Major, you've disobeyed a direct order. Headquarters said\n"
"they will overlook this incident if you return to your post\n"
"right now. So, sir, please...!"
msgstr ""
"Майоре, ви грубо порушили наказ. Об'єднаний штаб каже,\n"
"що, якщо повернетеся зараз, вас навіть не каратимуть.\n"
"Тому, будь ласка, негайно поверніться до загону."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_03"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 少佐は師団長であり英雄という
#. JA:   非常に重要な立場のお方です。
#. JA:   隊を混乱させるようなことをなさっては――。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_04"
msgid ""
"You're a war hero with a very important position. \n"
"If you don't go back, you could be tried as a deserter. \n"
"Your trial would cause an uproar in the Librarium."
msgstr ""
"Майоре, ви командир дивізії та герой — людина, яка\n"
"обіймає вкрай важливу посаду. Ви не повинні сіяти безлад\n"
"у військах..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: それに、今回の任務は本来私に下されたもののはずです。
#. JA:   なぜ少佐がカグツチへ
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_05"
msgid ""
"And...this particular mission was assigned to me.\n"
"Why are you here in Kagutsuchi, Major...?"
msgstr ""
"До того ж це завдання мали доручити мені. Чому ви\n"
"прибули до Каґуцучі, майоре?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 黙れ、この「障害」。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_06"
msgid "Get out of my way."
msgstr "Замовкни, «перешкодо»."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: え？少佐、何を。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_07"
msgid "Eh? Major, what are you...?"
msgstr "П-пане майоре... Що ви...?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 貴様はなんだ……貴様は、貴様はなんだ？
#. JA:   貴様はなんなんだ？貴様はなんなんだ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_08"
msgid "Who... Who... Who the hell do you think you are!?"
msgstr ""
"Що ти таке...? Ти... ти що таке? Що ти таке? ЩО ТИ,\n"
"БЛЯТЬ, ТАКЕ?!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ……少佐？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_09"
msgid "...Major?"
msgstr "...Майоре?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: おまえ　しね。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_10"
msgid "Why don't you just...go die...?"
msgstr "Ти. Помри."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: やめてくださいっ、っくぅ。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_11"
msgid "S-Stop it...sir...!"
msgstr "Припиніть... Кх..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 屑が、屑が、屑が！！消えろ、この障害……ん？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_12"
msgid ""
"You trash... Scum! Get out of my way!\n"
"...Hm?"
msgstr "Сміття, сміття, сміття!! Зникни, клята «перешкодо»... Гм?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: しょ、少佐……。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_13"
msgid "M-Ma...jor..."
msgstr "М-майоре..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN02_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ああ、そっちにいたのか――。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN02_14"
msgid "Oh, that's where you were..."
msgstr "А, ось де ти..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: はぁっ、はぁっ……。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_00"
msgid "Haah... Haah..."
msgstr "Ха... ха..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 不思議な空間だ。まるで全てが止まっているようだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_01"
msgid ""
"This is an odd place...\n"
"It's like time has completely stopped."
msgstr "Дивний простір. Наче все завмерло."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ！？っテメェ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_02"
msgid ""
"!?\n"
"You bastard!"
msgstr "!? Ти!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: いきなり斬りかかってくるなんてひどいじゃないか。
#. JA:   あれ、怪我をしてるようだけど大丈夫？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_03"
msgid ""
"That was pretty harsh, just attacking me like that...\n"
"Hm? You look injured... Are you OK?"
msgstr ""
"Одразу кидатися з мечем — хіба не жорстоко? А ти, схоже,\n"
"поранений. Усе гаразд?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: まったく、久しぶりだっていうのに、
#. JA:   相変わらず無茶してばかりだね、兄さん。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_04"
msgid ""
"It's been a long time, hasn't it?\n"
"You're reckless as always, Brother."
msgstr ""
"Ми ж так давно не бачилися, а ти й досі тільки й робиш,\n"
"що лізеш напролом, братику."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: なんでテメェがここにいやがる、ジン！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_05"
msgid "Why the hell are you here, Jin!?"
msgstr "Якого біса ти тут робиш, Джіне?!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: なんで？そんなの、兄さんに会いに来たに決まってるじゃないか。
#. JA:   ……くくく……くく……ははははは。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_06"
msgid ""
"\"Why\"? I thought that was obvious: to see you, Brother!\n"
"...Heheh...haha...ahahaha!"
msgstr ""
"Якого? Звісно ж, прийшов побачитися з тобою, братику.\n"
"...Хе-хе... хе... ха-ха-ха-ха!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 何がおかしい！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_07"
msgid "What's so funny!?"
msgstr "Що тут смішного?!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 嬉しいんだ、兄さんが生きてるなんて、
#. JA:   また会えて、また”殺せる”なんて！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_08"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm just happy you're alive...\n"
"Now I get to kill you again!"
msgstr ""
"Я просто щасливий, що ти живий, братику. Ми знову\n"
"зустрілися... і я знову можу тебе «вбити»!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 駄目だよ兄さん、そんなんじゃ全然楽しめないよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_09"
msgid "No... Brother, that wasn't fun at all!"
msgstr "Так не годиться, братику. З тобою зовсім не весело."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: やべぇ、あのお面野郎につけられた傷、全然治らねぇぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_10"
msgid ""
"Damn it... The wounds from that asshole in the mask\n"
"aren't healing..."
msgstr "Лайно... Рани від тієї паскуди в масці зовсім не гояться."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 兄さん、まだ全然足りないよ。もっと、もっと楽しもうよ――
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_11"
msgid "Brother...this isn't enough... I need more than that..."
msgstr ""
"Братику, цього й близько не досить. Нумо ще, ще\n"
"повеселимося..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: クソが……！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_12"
msgid "You piece of shit...!"
msgstr "Паскуда...!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_13"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "!?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN03_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
msgctxt "ArcEveJN03_14"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "!?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 何者だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_01"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "Ти хто?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_02"
msgid "Scanning: complete. Auto-mode: confirmed."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ユキアネサが反応している？
#. JA:   くっ、何かが、流れ込んでくる――情報？いや、これは記憶？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_03"
msgid ""
"Yukianesa is reacting...\n"
"Hurgh... Something's...something's flowing into me...\n"
"...Information? No...these are...memories..."
msgstr ""
"Юкіанеса реагує? Кх, щось вливається в мене...\n"
"Інформація? Ні, це... спогади?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……
#. JA:   対象を障害と認識、排除を実行します
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_04"
msgid ""
"Scanning: complete. IFF determined. Processing...\n"
"Subject is hostile. Activate termination protocol."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"схвалено... Ціль ідентифіковано як перешкоду. Розпочинаю\n"
"усунення."

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ああ、そうか、そうなのか。
#. JA:   これか、こいつなのか……貴様が、「敵」か！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_05"
msgid ""
"Oh... I see...\n"
"So that's what you are... You...are the enemy!"
msgstr ""
"Он як... Ось воно що... Тепер усе зрозуміло! То це ти...\n"
"«ворог»!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: チッ！！どうなっているんだ！？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_06"
msgid "Gah! What's going on!?"
msgstr "Тц!! Що відбувається?!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: すぐに会えるわ。またね、「えいゆう」さん。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_07"
msgid "Until we meet again. Good-bye, Mr. Hero."
msgstr "Скоро ти з ним зустрінешся. Бувай, пане «герою»."

#. Key: ArcEveJN04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: なんだと！？あいつはどこだ！
#. JA:   兄さんは、兄さんは！？貴様――――――――――！！
msgctxt "ArcEveJN04_08"
msgid ""
"What!? Where is he!?\n"
"Brother... Brother...!? You bastard!"
msgstr "Що?! Де він?! Братику... Де братик?! Ах ти ж...!!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ふう、やはりここが一番落ち着く。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_00"
msgid "Hmm...This is the only place I can feel relaxed anymore."
msgstr "Фух... Тут таки найспокійніше."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_01_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 当たり障りのない振る舞いは面倒なだけだし
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_01_0"
msgid "Trying to act nice around others isn't my forte,"
msgstr "Удавати люб'язність з усіма — лише зайвий клопіт."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_01_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: それに人が多いのは苦手だよ兄さん
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_01_1"
msgid "and I'm not really good around crowds of people either...Brother."
msgstr "Та й натовпу я не люблю, братику."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_01_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ……なんだ？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_01_2"
msgid "...Hm?"
msgstr "...Гм?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: す、すみませ～～～～ん、それ私のです～～～～。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_02"
msgid "I'm sorry... That's mine..."
msgstr "П-перепрошую-ю-ю! Це моє-є-є!"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_03_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ん？　あ、ああ、これか。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_03_0"
msgid "Hm? Oh, this?"
msgstr "Гм? А-а, це?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_03_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: ここは急に強い風が吹くことがあるから、気をつけて。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_03_1"
msgid "It can get really windy here, so you should be careful."
msgstr "Тут іноді раптово здіймається вітер. Будь обережна."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 君は、新入生か？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_04"
msgid "Are you new here?"
msgstr "Ти новенька?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: はあ、はあ……あ、ありがとうございます。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_05"
msgid "Y-Yes... Thank you very much."
msgstr "Ха... ха... Д-дякую вам."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: あ、あの、私、ノエル＝ヴァーミリオンといいます。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_06_0"
msgid "U-Um... My name is Noel Vermillion... A first year."
msgstr "Е-е-е... Мене звати Ноель Верміліон."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 今年士官学校に入学しました１学年です、よろしくお願いします。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_06_1"
msgid "I joined the Military Academy this year. P-Pleased to meet you."
msgstr ""
"Цього року я вступила до Військової академії, на перший\n"
"курс. Рада знайомству."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 僕はジン＝キサラギ、３学年だ、よろしく。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_07"
msgid "I'm Jin Kisaragi, a third year. Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Я Джін Кісараґі, третьокурсник. Радий знайомству."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_08_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: で、ヴァーミリオン君だったよね？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_08_0"
msgid "Um... Miss Vermillion, was it?"
msgstr "Тебе ж звати Верміліон, так?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_08_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 顔を上げないで挨拶するのは失礼じゃないかな？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_08_1"
msgid "Isn't it a little rude to look at the ground when you greet people?"
msgstr "Хіба не неввічливо вітатися, не підводячи голови?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: あ！すみません、すみません。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_09"
msgid "Ah! I'm sorry... I'm so sorry!"
msgstr "А! Перепрошую, перепрошую."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_10"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "!?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_11_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: あ、あ、あの、あの、すみませんキサラギ先輩
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_11_0"
msgid "U-U-Umm... I'm very sorry, uh, Jin..."
msgstr "Е-е-е... В-вибачте, старшокурснику Кісараґі..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_11_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: それ、返していただけませんか？
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_11_1"
msgid "...but...could you give that back?"
msgstr "Ви не могли б повернути мені це?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: え？あ、ああ、すまない。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_12"
msgid "Huh? O-Oh...right. Here you go."
msgstr "Що? А, так. Вибач."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: なんだ？何者だ、あの女。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_13"
msgid "Who the hell is that girl?"
msgstr "Що?.. Хто в біса та жінка?"

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_14_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: 似てるなどという話ではない、あれはそのままじゃないか。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_14_0"
msgid "Saying they look like twins would be an understatement..."
msgstr ""
"Не можна сказати, що вони просто схожі. Вона —\n"
"точнісінько та сама."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_14_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: くそっ、せっかく忘れていたのに
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_14_1"
msgid "That girl looks just like her. Damn."
msgstr "Чорт, я ж нарешті почав забувати..."

#. Key: ArcEveJN05_14_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveJN_ArcEveJN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveJN.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Jin
#. JA: イライラする……。
msgctxt "ArcEveJN05_14_2"
msgid "Just when I was beginning to forget... How frustrating."
msgstr "Як же це дратує..."
